  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:102px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Lieutenant.jpg\" title=\"Townston Lieutenant\"><img alt=\"Townston Lieutenant\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"228\" src=\"/images/Lieutenant.jpg\" width=\"100\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Lieutenant.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Townston Lieutenant</div></div></div>\n<p>The Townston Lieutenant is just along the path as you head from the <a href=\"/wiki/Obelisk\" title=\"Obelisk\">Obelisk</a> towards <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a> and almost opposite <a href=\"/wiki/Deward_the_Arms_Merchant\" title=\"Deward the Arms Merchant\">Deward the Arms Merchant</a>. \n</p><p>He gives many quests. \n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Townston_Lieutenant_Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Townston Lieutenant Quests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Algernon\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Algernon</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Algor.27s_Terror_Dome\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Algor's Terror Dome</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Vergrim.27s_Vexation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vergrim's Vexation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#The_Widower.27s_Nest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Widower's Nest</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Townston_Lieutenant_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Townston Lieutenant Quests</span></h2>\n<a name=\"Algernon\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Audit_Algernon_Quests\" title=\"Category:Audit Algernon Quests\">Audit Algernon Quests</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mission_Important_Quests\" title=\"Category:Mission Important Quests\">Mission Important Quests</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Back_on_the_Wagon\" title=\"Back on the Wagon\">Back on the Wagon</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Hops_to_Conclusions\" title=\"Hops to Conclusions\">Hops to Conclusions</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Squeakeasies\" title=\"Squeakeasies\">Squeakeasies</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Algor.27s_Terror_Dome\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Terra-Infirma\" title=\"Audit Terra-Infirma\">Audit Terra-Infirma</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Vergrim.27s_Vexation\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Audit Vergrim's Vexation\">Audit Vergrim's Vexation</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"The_Widower.27s_Nest\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Viral_Infestation\" title=\"Viral Infestation\">Viral Infestation</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
